    "agent_final_response": "\n\nPerfect! I've completed all three tasks:\n\n## 1. Email Found and Read ✓\nI found the email from **Rachel Torres** (rtorres@techstartsolutions.com), Director of Operations at TechStart Solutions, with the subject \"Inquiry about your enterprise solutions.\" She's interested in CRM and workflow automation solutions for her growing tech startup of about 50 employees.\n\n## 2. Lead Created in CRM ✓\nI've created a new lead record with the following details:\n- **Name:** Rachel Torres\n- **Title:** Director of Operations\n- **Company:** TechStart Solutions\n- **Email:** rtorres@techstartsolutions.com\n- **Phone:** 555-8901\n- **Lead Source:** Web\n- **Status:** New\n- **Lead ID:** 93139e79-3f97-7f60-dff0-6acfe8c36db3\n\n## 3. Reply Email Sent ✓\nI've replied to Rachel's email with a confirmation message that includes:\n- The exact phrase \"inquiry has been received\"\n- A link to the onboarding portal at https://acme-enterprise.com/get-started\n- Information that her inquiry has been logged in the system and the team will follow up\n\nThe email was sent successfully from alex.turner@acme-enterprise.com to rtorres@techstartsolutions.com.",
